ression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu","source_id":"s-shiji-093-hanlu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:p007","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/093.json"}],"normalized_date":{"era":"BCE","era_year":164,"year":-163,"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"信之入匈奴，與太子俱；及至穨當城，生子，因名曰穨當。韓太子亦生子，命曰嬰。至孝文十四年，穨當及嬰率其眾降漢。漢封穨當為弓高侯，嬰為襄城侯。吳楚軍時，弓高侯功冠諸將。傳子至孫，孫無子，失侯。嬰孫以不敬失侯。穨當孽孫韓嫣，貴幸，名富顯於當世。其弟說，再封，數稱將軍，卒為案道侯。子代，歲餘坐法死。後歲餘，說孫曾拜為龍頟侯，續說後。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu","source_id":"s-shiji-093-hanlu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:p007","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/093.json"}],"references":[{"title":"《史記·惠景間侯者年表》授侯元年欄","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷019&oldid=6359260","quote":"八。十六年六月丙子，莊侯韓頹當元年。","table_cell_id":"shiji-019-t3-r024-c02","scope":"received_parallel_event","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記·漢興以來諸侯王年表》數位年欄","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷017&oldid=2607010","quote":"164","table_cell_id":"shiji-017-t1-r043-c00","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false}],"basis":{"kind":"parallel_event","source_event_quote":"漢封穨當為弓高侯","reference_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷019&oldid=6359260","reference_event_quote":"八。十六年六月丙子，莊侯韓頹當元年。","reference_year_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷017&oldid=2607010","reference_year_quote":"164"},"rationale":"本傳孝文十四年先記降漢，漢封侯未明授爵年；侯者年表對應同人及爵位，授侯元年明記十六年六月丙子，首選公元前164年，不把降漢年當授爵年。襄城／襄成原字各存，未核書影。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"按實授、自立與用稱保存；許韓王在先不作已授。明示相對年月保持原文，死亡、降漢、失侯之後裔敘事不替本人任期補終點。虜綰原字保留，以本段盧綰主語承接授爵，未核底本影像。 本傳十四年只用作降漢背景，不作授侯起年；依年表同人授爵元年另作暫定數值對讀。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji106-034","person_id":"l9e_fbr_36a_*AB","title":"弓高侯","kind":"noble_rank","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evi